-- Single-row, three-component, three-phase compositional case probing how
-- an explicit SWAT is combined with an overall composition (ZMF) at
-- initialization. The cells are isolated (MULTX = 0) and there are no
-- wells, so each cell is an independent probe:
--
--  cell name         pressure   temp.     input  probes
--   1  anchor         75.0 bar 150.0 C  SWAT 0.20  1D_COMP_NO_WELLS_DUMMY_WATER cell 15
--   2  swat005        75.0 bar 150.0 C  SWAT 0.05  SWAT dependence
--   3  swat050        75.0 bar 150.0 C  SWAT 0.50  SWAT dependence
--   4  swat080        75.0 bar 150.0 C  SWAT 0.80  SWAT dependence
--   5  t100           75.0 bar 100.0 C  SWAT 0.20  per-cell TEMPI
--   6  3root_gliq     10.0 bar 150.0 C  SWAT 0.20  3 roots, Gibbs picks liquid
--   7  3root_gvap     10.0 bar 150.0 C  SWAT 0.20  3 roots, Gibbs picks vapour
--   8  1p_liq3root     3.0 bar 150.0 C  SWAT 0.20  single-phase liquid, 3 roots
--   9  1p_gas        150.0 bar 150.0 C  SWAT 0.20  single-phase gas, 1 root
--
-- As the SGAS deck, with SSHIFT volume translation.

------------------------------------------------------------------------
RUNSPEC
------------------------------------------------------------------------
TITLE
   EXPLICIT SWAT PROBES SSHIFT

